# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files regardless of platform or
# local core.autocrlf settings. Windows CI runners default to
# core.autocrlf=true, which checks text files out with CRLF; several tests
# (agents/validate_test.go frontmatter parsing, cmd/tms golden-file byte
# comparisons) depend on files being exactly what was committed.
* text=auto eol=lf
